=== QT003 QT006 QT008 profile: general | a qSQL phrase ends an operand at from, by, where and a column's comma (q 5: each is 'type or 'length)
r1:select b:1+`x from t
r2:select b:til 1.5 from t
r3:exec 1 2 3+4 5 from t
r4:select b:1+`x,c:a from t
r5:select by b:1+`x from t
r6:select from t where a=1+`x, a>1

=== clean profile: general | outside a phrase, and in the from phrase, a comma joins; a lookup continues the operand
c1:select from t,u where a>1
c2:f[1+`x,y]
c3:1+`x,y
c4:til 1.5,x
c5:select b:1+`x`y?`y from t
c6:select from t where a in til 3, b>1
